# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4.5 Key takeaways on quantum teleportation {#45-key-takeaways-on-quantum-teleportation}"
msgstr "4.5 Pengambilan utama mengenai teleportasi kuantum {#45-key-takeaways-on-quantum-teleportation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We can transport a quantum state to a distant friend by sharing a pair of entangled qubits (an e-bit).\n"
msgstr "Kita boleh mengangkut keadaan kuantum kepada rakan yang jauh dengan berkongsi sepasang qubit yang terbelit (e-bit).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Can quantum teleportation send the quantum state faster than light?\n"
"\tNo, because Alice has to tell Bob the measurement results in a classical way.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Bolehkah teleportasi kuantum menghantar keadaan kuantum lebih laju daripada cahaya?\n"
"\tTidak, kerana Alice perlu memberitahu Bob keputusan pengukuran dengan cara klasik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Would quantum teleportation break the \"no cloning theorem\", which forbids copying of a quantum state?\n"
"\tNo, because the original quantum state given to Alice on one of her qubits was lost in measurement. It collapsed to a $|0\\rangle$ or $|1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"2. Adakah teleportasi kuantum akan melanggar \"teorem tiada pengklonan\", yang melarang penyalinan keadaan kuantum?\n"
"\tTidak, kerana keadaan kuantum asal yang diberikan kepada Alice pada salah satu Qubitnya telah hilang semasa pengukuran. Ia telah runtuh kepada $|0\\rangle$ atau $|1\\rangle$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Superdense coding {#5-superdense-coding}"
msgstr "5. Pengekodan superpadu {#5-superdense-coding}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Almost the same setup can be used for a different purpose. Suppose Alice wants to send Bob two bits of classical information, but she has no means of classical communication with Bob. She does, however, share an entangled pair with Bob and she is allowed to send her qubit to Bob's location. Notice the contrast with the quantum teleportation protocol. In teleportation, classical communication _was_ available to the friends, and the goal was to send a quantum state. Here, classical communication is not accessible and they use the transfer of a qubit to share two bits of classical information.\n"
msgstr "Persediaan yang hampir sama boleh digunakan untuk tujuan yang berbeza. Katakan Alice ingin menghantar dua bit maklumat klasik kepada Bob, tetapi dia tiada cara komunikasi klasik dengan Bob. Namun, mereka berkongsi pasangan terbelit dan Alice dibenarkan menghantar qubitnya ke lokasi Bob. Perhatikan perbezaan dengan protokol teleportasi kuantum. Dalam teleportasi, komunikasi klasik _memang_ tersedia untuk mereka berdua, dan matlamatnya adalah untuk menghantar keadaan kuantum. Di sini, komunikasi klasik tidak boleh diakses dan mereka menggunakan pemindahan satu qubit untuk berkongsi dua bit maklumat klasik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "5.1 The protocol of superdense coding {#51-the-protocol-of-superdense-coding}"
msgstr "5.1 Protokol pengekodan superpadu {#51-the-protocol-of-superdense-coding}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Assumption**: Alice has two bits of information, say, $a_1a_2 \\in \\{00, 01, 10, 11\\}$. Alice and Bob share an entangled pair (e-bit), but they cannot communicate classically.\n"
msgstr "**Andaian**: Alice mempunyai dua bit maklumat, katakan, $a_1a_2 \\in \\{00, 01, 10, 11\\}$. Alice dan Bob berkongsi pasangan terbelit (e-bit), tetapi mereka tidak boleh berkomunikasi secara klasik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alice performs one of the following operations on her part of e-bit.\n"
msgstr "Alice melakukan salah satu operasi berikut pada bahagiannya dalam e-bit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If $a_1a_2 = 00$, she does nothing\n"
msgstr "Jika $a_1a_2 = 00$, dia tidak buat apa-apa\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If $a_1a_2 = 01$, she applies Z gate\n"
msgstr "Jika $a_1a_2 = 01$, dia menerapkan get Z\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If $a_1a_2 = 10$, she applies X gate\n"
msgstr "Jika $a_1a_2 = 10$, dia menerapkan get X\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If $a_1a_2 = 11$, she applies Z gate and X gate.\n"
msgstr "Jika $a_1a_2 = 11$, dia menerapkan get Z dan get X.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alice sends her part of the e-bit to Bob's location.\n"
msgstr "Alice menghantar bahagiannya dalam e-bit ke lokasi Bob.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Bob applies a CNOT gate with the qubit from Alice as control and his qubit as target, then applies H gate to the qubit from Alice, and measures the two qubits. The possible starting states and results of Bob's operations are:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |00\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |01\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|10\\rangle + |01\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |10\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|10\\rangle - |01\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow -|11\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"3. Bob menerapkan get CNOT dengan qubit dari Alice sebagai kawalan dan Qubitnya sebagai sasaran, kemudian menerapkan get H pada qubit dari Alice, dan mengukur dua qubit tersebut. Kemungkinan keadaan permulaan dan hasil operasi Bob adalah:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |00\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |01\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|10\\rangle + |01\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow |10\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac {|10\\rangle - |01\\rangle}{\\sqrt 2} \\rightarrow CX_{01}\\otimes H_0 \\rightarrow -|11\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that a negative sign of $-|11\\rangle$ is global phase, so it is not measurable.\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahawa tanda negatif pada $-|11\\rangle$ adalah fasa global, jadi ia tidak boleh diukur.\n"

